Package: com.musiccc.musicdrop
Name: MusicDrop
Version: 1.6.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Import your own audio files into the Music app, on-device.
 Pick MP3, M4A, WAV, AIFF, or FLAC files with the floating button,
 or download supported audio and YouTube URLs. MusicDrop reads tags
 and artwork, then hands the file to the Music app's own importer.
Maintainer: musiccc
Author: musiccc
Section: Tweaks
Depends: firmware (>= 15.0), mobilesubstrate
Priority: optional
Tag: purpose::extension, compatible::ios15, compatible::ios16
